<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>로그인 실패 - WANG BOARD</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
    <style>
        .failure-card {
            background-color: var(--card-bg);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            border-top: 4px solid var(--neon-pink);
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 40px;
            text-align: center;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5), 0 0 20px rgba(255, 123, 114, 0.1);
            max-width: 450px;
            margin: 50px auto;
        }
        .failure-icon {
            font-size: 4rem;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            filter: drop-shadow(0 0 10px rgba(255, 123, 114, 0.5));
        }
        .btn-retry {
            background-color: var(--neon-pink);
            color: white;
            box-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(255, 123, 114, 0.4);
        }
        .btn-retry:hover {
            box-shadow: 0 0 25px rgba(255, 123, 114, 0.6);
            transform: translateY(-2px);
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <header>
            <a href="/" class="logo">WANG BOARD</a>
            <nav>
                <a href="/login">로그인</a>
                <a href="/signup">회원가입</a>
            </nav>
        </header>

        <main>
            <div class="failure-card">
                <div class="failure-icon">🚫</div>
                <h2 style="color: var(--neon-pink); margin-bottom: 20px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 10px;">
                    <span>로그인 실패</span>
                </h2>
                <p style="color: var(--text-primary); margin-bottom: 35px; font-size: 1.1rem; line-height: 1.6;">
                    입력하신 아이디 또는 비밀번호가<br>
                    일치하지 않습니다. 다시 시도해주세요.
                </p>
                <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 15px;">
                    <a href="/login" class="btn btn-retry" style="padding: 12px; font-weight: bold;">다시 로그인하기</a>
                    <a href="/signup" class="btn btn-outline" style="padding: 12px;">아직 회원이 아니신가요?</a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </main>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
